  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "**Will** is a modal: it takes the base form of a verb with no **to**, adds no **-s**, and has no infinitive or **-ing** form of its own. It is not normally used in a **when** or **if** clause about the future, where English uses the present tense instead, except to show willingness or insistence.",
